{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the first exhibit of The Midnight Exorcist!<br><br>// DISCOVER THE MUSEUM  <br> <br>The dark galleries of the Royal Guardian Museum are yours to explore as The Midnight Exorcist; a master of the arcane called in to investigate a deadly accident. <br> <br>// REVEAL MAGICAL SECRETS <br> <br>Use the Exorcist\u2019s tools to uncover the hidden depths of the Museum and the artifacts it contains. Solve puzzles and unlock new areas as you assemble the clues to the Museum\u2019s many mysteries. <br> <br> // CONFRONT ANCIENT EVILS <br> <br>Malevolent spirits stalk your every move as you make your way through the shadowy halls, and they do not take kindly to your presence. Avoid their traps and learn their weaknesses to eventually banish their ghost-forms and bring light and life back to the Museum.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723860?t=1747081770","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723860?t=1747081770","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723860/c6d0a08eb802c0a5c6af1de380aebecd02908614/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747081770","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723860/c6d0a08eb802c0a5c6af1de380aebecd02908614/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747081770","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the first exhibit of The Midnight Exorcist!<br><br>// DISCOVER THE MUSEUM  <br> <br>The dark galleries of the Royal Guardian Museum are yours to explore as The Midnight Exorcist; a master of the arcane called in to investigate a deadly accident. <br> <br>// REVEAL MAGICAL SECRETS <br> <br>Use the Exorcist\u2019s tools to uncove